<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 11.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 11.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio noon news report on Friday.  Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The justice minister has warned companies that they must re-register in the Companies' Register before September 1, 1997.</p>
<p>- The Estonian language is viewed more positively in Narva according to the local Estonian language inspector.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
